--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,6 +8,15 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Tool input is validated against each tool's declared `inputSchema` before its executor runs. A call the
+  schema rejects returns a tool result naming what was wrong (a missing required property, a wrong type) so
+  the model can correct the call on its next round instead of crashing the turn with a transport error.
+  Executors now receive only input the schema accepts; unknown extra properties may still be present, and
+  types are never coerced or defaulted. Schemas compile at registration, so a broken schema fails at
+  startup rather than mid-conversation.
+
